WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Sit with legs extended forward, spine tall.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Inhale and reach the arms up to lengthen the spine.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Exhale and hinge from the hips, reaching toward the feet.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold the shins, feet, or a strap. Keep the spine long.
